# S34-T03: wait for a process instead of a fixed pause. Replace the objects, columns and values with those of your site.
use Supervisor
open UsrOrderPage for UsrOrderRecord
click CloseButton
wait-record UsrOrder Id=UsrOrderRecord has UsrStatus eq Done within 30 second
wait-count UsrOrderLog UsrOrder/Id=UsrOrderRecord ge 1 within 60 second
